  "content": {
    "id": "p32-q12-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "The law of cosines can be regarded as a generalisation of the Pythagorean Theorem to non-right-angled triangles, since it reduces to this theorem in the case where $\\angle C=90^\\circ$. Explain whether $a^2+b^2$ is larger or smaller than $c^2$ when $\\angle C$ is:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p32-q12a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "acute",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^2+b^2>c^2$.",
          "worked": "For an acute angle, $\\cos C>0$. Since side lengths are positive,\n$$\\begin{align*}c^2&=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos C\\\\c^2&<a^2+b^2.\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $a^2+b^2$ is larger than $c^2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q12b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "right",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^2+b^2=c^2$.",
          "worked": "For a right angle, $\\cos90^\\circ=0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}c^2&=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos90^\\circ\\\\c^2&=a^2+b^2.\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $a^2+b^2$ equals $c^2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q12c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "obtuse",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^2+b^2<c^2$.",
          "worked": "For an obtuse angle, $\\cos C<0$, so $-2ab\\cos C>0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}c^2&=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos C\\\\c^2&>a^2+b^2.\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $a^2+b^2$ is smaller than $c^2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      }
    ]
  },
